PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{scheduleCancelInstanceId}}/transitions/cancel-schedule-manually
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Adim 4: Durum Kontrol - pre-complete-state olmali (timer iptali basarili)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{scheduleCancelInstanceId}}/functions/state

