### Adim 2: Durum Kontrol - auto-passed-state olmali
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{rescheduleInstanceId}}/functions/state

### Adim 3: Reschedule timer ($self transition - timer sifirlanmali)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{rescheduleInstanceId}}/transitions/reschedule-timer
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Adim 4: Durum Kontrol - hala auto-passed-state olmali ($self = ayni state)
