### ============================================================
### TEST: QueryRoles ve Transition Roles
### ============================================================

### Adim 1: Workflow Baslat (Roles Test)
# @name rolesCreate
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "roles-test-{{$timestamp}}",
  "tags": ["roles-test"],
  "attributes": {
    "testId": "roles-test",
    "testPath": "pass"
  }
}

### Response'dan instance ID'yi yakala
@rolesInstanceId = {{rolesCreate.response.body.$.id}}

### Adim 2: QueryRoles ile yetki kontrolu - test-viewer izinli olmali (workflow-level)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{rolesInstanceId}}/functions/authorize?role=test-viewer

### Adim 3: move-to-processing transition (test-operator rolu ile)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{rolesInstanceId}}/transitions/move-to-processing
Content-Type: application/json
role: test-operator

{}

### Adim 4: Durum Kontrol - processing-state olmali
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{rolesInstanceId}}/functions/state

### Adim 5: QueryRoles - processing-state'de test-processor izinli, test-viewer reddedilmis olmali
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{rolesInstanceId}}/functions/authorize?role=test-processor

### Adim 6: QueryRoles - test-viewer deny olmali (state-level override)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{rolesInstanceId}}/functions/authorize?role=test-viewer
